### 2. 基于物品的协同过滤 (Item-Based CF)

核心思想是：**“喜欢这个商品的人，也喜欢那个商品”**（物以类聚）。
Item-Based CF 并非根据物品属性（如颜色、品牌）计算相似度，而是根据**用户的交互历史**来计算物品之间的相似度。', '{"chunk_id": "f1de1747320221d885328362", "parent_id": "10be0612993a4e9e3b402f47", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "2. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7269\u54c1\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (Item-Based CF)"], "section_title": "2. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7269\u54c1\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (Item-Based CF)", "start_line": 185, "end_line": 188, "heading_line": 185, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 13, "chunk_chars": 213, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:39:39.721079+08');
