## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 1. 基于用户的协同过滤 (User-Based CF)

本代码实现的核心思想是：**“你和谁像，就买谁买过的东西”**。它挖掘用户历史行为的相似性，找到目标用户的“邻居”，利用邻居的偏好进行预测推荐。', '{"chunk_id": "9b6429fdc95f77fe94e4f773", "parent_id": "77765487581096b02021df5f", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "1. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7528\u6237\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (User-Based CF)"], "section_title": "1. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7528\u6237\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (User-Based CF)", "start_line": 65, "end_line": 67, "heading_line": 65, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 6, "chunk_chars": 186, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 1. 基于用户的协同过滤 (User-Based CF)
