## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 1. 基于用户的协同过滤 (User-Based CF)
#### 1.1 用户行为量化 (Implicit to Explicit Feedback)

原始数据包含浏览、收藏、加购、购买等隐式行为。为了构建评分矩阵，首先建立行为强度映射模型。

* **代码位置**：`behavior_score` 字典
* **建模公式**：
  设用户 `u` 对物品 `i` 的行为类型为 $b_{ui}$，则评分 $r_{ui}$ 定义为：

$$
r_{ui} = \sum w(b_{ui})
$$

其中权重 $w$ 映射如下：

* 浏览 (pv) = 1
  * 收藏 (fav) = 2
  * 加购 (cart) = 3
  * 购买 (buy) = 4
* **实现细节**：如果用户对同一商品有多次相同行为，在构建矩阵时采用 `sum` 聚合，即多次浏览权重会累加，体现更强的兴趣。', '{"chunk_id": "13cd5b32f7e7edbb8d12aef2", "parent_id": "13d6ee291aedb1865e684120", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "1. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7528\u6237\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (User-Based CF)", "1.1 \u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u91cf\u5316 (Implicit to Explicit Feedback)"], "section_title": "1.1 \u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u91cf\u5316 (Implicit to Explicit Feedback)", "start_line": 75, "end_line": 93, "heading_line": 75, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 8, "chunk_chars": 483, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
