### 1. 基于用户的协同过滤 (User-Based CF)
#### 1.2 构建用户-物品评分矩阵 (User-Item Matrix Construction)

将长表（Log Data）转换为宽表矩阵，这是协同过滤的基础数据结构。

* **代码位置**：`build_user_item_matrix` 函数
* **数学表示**：
  构建矩阵 $R_{m \times n}$，其中 `m` 为用户数，`n` 为物品数。

$$
R = \begin{bmatrix}
r_{11} & r_{12} & \cdots & r_{1n} \\\\
r_{21} & r_{22} & \cdots & r_{2n} \\\\
\vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\\\
r_{m1} & r_{m2} & \cdots & r_{mn}
\end{bmatrix}
$$

矩阵极其稀疏，未交互项填充为 $0$。', '{"chunk_id": "d805cafa22639e0ba2aafe3d", "parent_id": "dd0d7b6161c3511e72c2a5f7", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "1. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7528\u6237\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (User-Based CF)", "1.2 \u6784\u5efa\u7528\u6237-\u7269\u54c1\u8bc4\u5206\u77e9\u9635 (User-Item Matrix Construction)"], "section_title": "1.2 \u6784\u5efa\u7528\u6237-\u7269\u54c1\u8bc4\u5206\u77e9\u9635 (User-Item Matrix Construction)", "start_line": 95, "end_line": 112, "heading_line": 95, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 9, "chunk_chars": 513, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 1. 基于用户的协同过滤 (User-Based CF)
#### 1.3 用户相似度计算 (User Similarity Calculation)

寻找与目标用户兴趣相似的群体。本代码采用 **余弦相似度 (Cosine Similarity)**，它衡量的是用户向量在多维空间中方向的一致性，而非距离。

* **代码位置**：`compute_user_similarity` 函数
* **核心公式**：
  设用户 `u` 和用户 `v` 的评分向量分别为 $\vec{r}_u$ 和 $\vec{r}_v$，其相似度 $\text{sim}(u,v)$ 为：

$$
\text{sim}(u, v) = \cos(\theta) = \frac{\vec{r}_u \cdot \vec{r}_v}{\Vert \vec{r}_u \Vert \Vert \vec{r}_v \Vert} = \frac{\sum_{i \in I} r_{ui} r_{vi}}{\sqrt{\sum_{i \in I} r_{ui}^2} \sqrt{\sum_{i \in I} r_{vi}^2}}
$$

其中 $I$ 是所有物品的集合。代码直接调用 `sklearn.metrics.pairwise.cosine_similarity` 高效实现矩阵运算。', '{"chunk_id": "12a8a3a5a52403d8b47f8419", "parent_id": "e76b1fc3bb196eb561378ac8", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "1. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7528\u6237\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (User-Based CF)", "1.3 \u7528\u6237\u76f8\u4f3c\u5ea6\u8ba1\u7b97 (User Similarity Calculation)"], "section_title": "1.3 \u7528\u6237\u76f8\u4f3c\u5ea6\u8ba1\u7b97 (User Similarity Calculation)", "start_line": 114, "end_line": 126, "heading_line": 114, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 10, "chunk_chars": 670, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 1. 基于用户的协同过滤 (User-Based CF)
#### 1.4 评分预测与 Top-N 推荐 (Prediction & Generation)

基于相似邻居的偏好，预测目标用户对未交互物品的感兴趣程度。

* **代码位置**：`generate_recommendations` 函数
* **步骤详解**：
  1. **邻居选择**：对于目标用户 `u`，在相似度矩阵中找到相似度最高的 `K` 个用户，构成邻居集合 $N(u)$。
  2. **加权预测**：利用邻居对物品 `i` 的评分 $r_{vi}$，以相似度 $\text{sim}(u,v)$ 为权重进行加权平均。
  3. **过滤已交互**：排除用户历史已经产生过行为的物品。
  4. **Top-N 排序**：对预测评分降序排列，取前 `N` 个作为最终推荐列表。', '{"chunk_id": "9f8cb5c0f3d9280b7701e4b6", "parent_id": "728d9e04cf604f6543d35f3a", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "1. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7528\u6237\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (User-Based CF)", "1.4 \u8bc4\u5206\u9884\u6d4b\u4e0e Top-N \u63a8\u8350 (Prediction & Generation)"], "section_title": "1.4 \u8bc4\u5206\u9884\u6d4b\u4e0e Top-N \u63a8\u8350 (Prediction & Generation)", "start_line": 128, "end_line": 137, "heading_line": 128, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 11, "chunk_chars": 463, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
