## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 2. 基于物品的协同过滤 (Item-Based CF)
#### 2.1 物品相似度计算 (Item Similarity Calculation)

* **代码位置**：`compute_item_similarity` 函数
* **核心逻辑**：
  计算物品 `i` 和物品 `j` 的相似度，看这两个物品是否经常被同一个用户一起购买/浏览。

$$
\text{sim}(i, j) = \cos(\vec{r}_i, \vec{r}_j) = \frac{\sum_{u \in U} r_{ui} r_{uj}}{\sqrt{\sum_{u \in U} r_{ui}^2} \sqrt{\sum_{u \in U} r_{uj}^2}}
$$

其中 $\vec{r}_i$ 是物品 `i` 在所有用户上的评分向量。', '{"chunk_id": "960345e7f2073cbe505a3ff7", "parent_id": "42d1aa0bd053e127730d35e4", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "2. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7269\u54c1\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (Item-Based CF)", "2.1 \u7269\u54c1\u76f8\u4f3c\u5ea6\u8ba1\u7b97 (Item Similarity Calculation)"], "section_title": "2.1 \u7269\u54c1\u76f8\u4f3c\u5ea6\u8ba1\u7b97 (Item Similarity Calculation)", "start_line": 196, "end_line": 206, "heading_line": 196, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 15, "chunk_chars": 452, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
## 🧠 算法建模详解 (Algorithm Modeling)
### 2. 基于物品的协同过滤 (Item-Based CF)
#### 2.2 评分预测 (Prediction)

* **代码位置**：`generate_item_based_recommendations` 函数
* **预测公式**：
  目标用户 `u` 对未交互物品 `i` 的预测评分 $P_{ui}$：

$$
P_{ui} = \frac{\sum_{j \in N(i) \cap I_u} sim(i, j) \cdot r_{uj}}{\sum_{j \in N(i) \cap I_u} |sim(i, j)|}
$$

这里 $I_u$ 是用户 `u` 已经交互过的物品集合，$N(i)$ 是物品 `i` 的相似物品集合（Top-K）。
  简单来说，就是**用你过去喜欢的物品，去投票选出你可能喜欢的其他物品**。', '{"chunk_id": "edd9a422eb7234f44432c985", "parent_id": "db5463a8a84cd7ddc095859a", "child_index": 0, "chunk_type": "markdown_section", "section_path": ["\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "\ud83e\udde0 \u7b97\u6cd5\u5efa\u6a21\u8be6\u89e3 (Algorithm Modeling)", "2. \u57fa\u4e8e\u7269\u54c1\u7684\u534f\u540c\u8fc7\u6ee4 (Item-Based CF)", "2.2 \u8bc4\u5206\u9884\u6d4b (Prediction)"], "section_title": "2.2 \u8bc4\u5206\u9884\u6d4b (Prediction)", "start_line": 208, "end_line": 219, "heading_line": 208, "display_title": "\ud83d\uded2 \u6dd8\u5b9d\u7528\u6237\u884c\u4e3a\u5206\u6790\u4e0e\u63a8\u8350\u7cfb\u7edf (User-Based & Item-Based CF)", "path": "README.md", "root_path": "F:\\\u9762\u8bd5\\PRism\\backend\\.data\\repos\\6adf0fcb-f4b5-4124-b6a6-65a78721f19e-WJLGraph__Collaborative_-Filtering", "provenance_tier": "authoritative", "chunk_index": 16, "chunk_chars": 455, "total_chunks": 27, "chunk_strategy": "structure_aware_v1", "fingerprint": "files:f6e0af5af2df7d2ec91e93fc23af7a763492de5c64e364153dec693c72c593b2", "scanned_at": "2026-11-18T12:39:39.732013+00:00", "retrieval_mode": "rag", "rag_enabled": true}', '2026-11-18 20:41:28.508535+08');
